WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.114 --> 00:00:03.197
(upbeat piano music)

00:00:05.252 --> 00:00:07.342
- If you've been here before,
you'll notice something

00:00:07.342 --> 00:00:10.068
cropping up, time and time again.

00:00:10.068 --> 00:00:14.788
Hot thermal waters powering
Hungary's age-old love of spas.

00:00:14.788 --> 00:00:18.233
A love that can be traced
back thousands of years.

00:00:18.233 --> 00:00:21.483
A history that can still be seen today.

00:00:23.706 --> 00:00:26.730
Hungary has a unique geology
that allows deep thermal waters

00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:30.024
heated by the Earth's mantle
to spring to the surface.

00:00:30.024 --> 00:00:32.312
It's no surprise to hear, then,
that Hungarians have been

00:00:32.312 --> 00:00:35.334
making use of this for thousands of years.

00:00:35.334 --> 00:00:37.406
But how did this obsession begin?

00:00:37.406 --> 00:00:40.183
Well, we might have to get dirty for this.

00:00:40.183 --> 00:00:42.766
Let's start near the beginning.

00:01:06.959 --> 00:01:10.292
Now, let's skip forward a few centuries.

00:01:40.523 --> 00:01:44.190
And finally, to a time
that's more familiar.

00:02:29.275 --> 00:02:32.358
(gentle piano music)

